      "html" : "<\/div><div style=\"margin-bottom=10pt\">&#160;<\/div><\/div><div class=\"clearfix\"><\/div><div id=\"rid-0-0-0-178286\" class=\"rbox Normal-Level\"><AnnotationDrawer recordId=\"0-0-0-178286\"><\/AnnotationDrawer><div class=\"Small\">Note a: In accordance with AISI S240 Section D6.9.1, continuous special inspection of weld fit-up in lateral force-resisting systems may be reduced to periodic special inspection upon fulfillment of the conditions of Section D6.9.1.<\/div><\/div><div class=\"clearfix\"><\/div><div id=\"rid-0-0-0-178287\" class=\"rbox Normal-Level\"><AnnotationDrawer recordId=\"0-0-0-178287\"><\/AnnotationDrawer><div>(Am. L.L. 2021\/148, 12\/11\/2021, eff. 11\/7\/2022; Am. L.L. 2023\/077, 6\/11\/2023, eff. 6\/11\/2023) \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div><\/div><div class=\"clearfix\"><\/div><div id=\"rid-0-0-0-178288\" class=\"rbox Normal-Level\"><AnnotationDrawer recordId=\"0-0-0-178288\"><\/AnnotationDrawer><div class=\"EdNoteSm\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;font-style: normal;text-decoration:none;display: inline;\">Editor's note:<\/span> For related unconsolidated provisions, see Appendix A at <Link class=\"Jump\" to=\"{{ pathname: '\/codes\/newyorkcity\/latest\/NYCadmin\/0-0-0-135879', hash: '#JD_L.L.2021\/148' }}\">L.L. 2021\/148<\/Link> and <Link class=\"Jump\" to=\"{{ pathname: '\/codes\/newyorkcity\/latest\/NYCadmin\/0-0-0-224061', hash: '#JD_L.L.2023\/077' }}\">L.L. 2023\/077<\/Link>. \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div><\/div><div class=\"clearfix\"><\/div><div class=\"clearfix\"><\/div><\/div>",
